{"id":"628093","name":"黄瓜素馅水饺","author":"还在吃吃吃","authorId":"10106890","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/628093/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2枚"},{"name":"红薯粉条","amount":"100克"},{"name":"木耳碎","amount":"50克"},{"name":"鳞虾","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"3勺"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克面粉加盐加水合成软硬适中的面团，并醒发半小时。","img":"images/628093/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黄瓜洗净后切丝。","img":"images/628093/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"泡发木耳切丝后再切丁。","img":"images/628093/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"黄瓜丝用盐腌制好挤出水分装入盘中，加入木耳丁。","img":"images/628093/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"泡软的红薯粉条下入锅中烧水煮熟。","img":"images/628093/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用刀切成小丁加入老抽增加底味。","img":"images/628093/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将炒好的鸡蛋碎、粉条碎装入盘中，加入鳞虾。","img":"images/628093/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入葱花。","img":"images/628093/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入食盐。","img":"images/628093/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入胡椒粉。","img":"images/628093/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入鸡精。","img":"images/628093/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入蚝油。","img":"images/628093/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/628093/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"下面剂。","img":"images/628093/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"擀皮包上馅料。","img":"images/628093/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"包成自己熟悉的饺子形状。","img":"images/628093/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"水开之后下入饺子煮两开捞出。","img":"images/628093/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/628093/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}